[{"title":"吼山观石壁","author":"袁宏道","text":"知不是天造，良工匠意成。\n千年云气老，七日浑沌生。\n精祟虚无出，猿猱叹息行。\n道傍因借问，恐是越王城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44534,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰亭","author":"袁宏道","text":"定武石空在，兰亭迹已讹。\n清流大概是，峻岭果然多。\n古屋穿新霤，苍松瘦老柯。\n墨池閒贮水，犹得放邹鹅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44535,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸暨县","author":"袁宏道","text":"近水多鱼稻，依山即市廛。\n野人朝闭户，溪女夜牵船。\n俗健惟贪讼，田宽务积钱。\n僻居游辙少，客到也喧传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44536,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠高峰","author":"袁宏道","text":"捉得松为柄，粘来纸作衾。\n山云娇老态，溪水有无心。\n挂锡沉香树，安禅天竹林。\n西来闲会取，空迹寄飞禽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44537,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠海禅","author":"袁宏道","text":"海公知道者，闲雅好威仪。\n饷客云千斛，论心棒一枝。\n岂无真法友，毕竟所依谁。\n余亦贪佛去，因君乞圣师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44538,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿双清庄赠印上人","author":"袁宏道","text":"百折琉璃沸，千峰帝网罗。\n更忧尘界少，却碍岭云多。\n说法乌成马，穷源水是波。\n死关真个死，赚尔儿孙何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44539,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠莲小师","author":"袁宏道","text":"解法生明本，登山熟导师。\n闭门常礼忏，会境也题诗。\n耘石分香草，煎花供茗糜。\n人天一只眼，望汝小厮儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44540,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潘庚生馆同诸公得钱字","author":"袁宏道","text":"山色重重冶，云容片片鲜。\n花风香水气，梅雨润苔钱。\n茶别松萝味，兰销鹊尾烟。\n每于诗外旨，悟得句中禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44541,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠景升","author":"袁宏道","text":"麈柄韵如屑，匡床味似禅。\n闲惟追酒伴，忙亦检诗编。\n是客皆停辙，何人不道贤。\n聪明事事有，大抵只无钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44542,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿落石台山房 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"苍翠垂三亩，凉阴可一庭。\n茶烟和雾出，灯影入流青。\n快眼山容熟，蒸岩雨气腥。\n溪声寒到枕，阖户了遗经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44543,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿落石台山房 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"不独林园胜，居停更可儿。\n云生卧地石，山压傍墙枝。\n字母逢僧转，文心问水知。\n看君举业好，岐路不须疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44544,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛溪","author":"袁宏道","text":"小筏平如舫，文纱蔽赤栏。\n只贪下水易，谁识上滩难。\n蕨粉和为馔，石班鲙作盘。\n梅天多骤雨，重来晚亦寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44545,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"一里垂千折，一山近万盘。\n草髡和尚岭，石腐秀才滩。\n入峡逢天小，投厓叹鸟难。\n轻舟薄似纸，未惯也心寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44546,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"咫尺愁溪尽，萦回觉路疑。\n小舟尖似履，细缆密如丝。\n下水贪奇峻，归舟叹崄巇。\n相逢不用羡，亦有放流时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44547,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"怪石穿江出，江寒石亦寒。\n或从舟底见，或作假山看。\n聚客多茶店，逢人上米滩。\n溪流虽较险，下水也平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44548,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其四","author":"袁宏道","text":"浪恶石尤恶，肤青骨亦青。\n玄岩听鬼语，野烧炙龙醒。\n树古疑唐族，碑攲或宋铭。\n可知太白老，浪说有猩猩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44549,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其五","author":"袁宏道","text":"市郭全然少，崖邹大底同。\n溪云千片黑，山火一丝红。\n暴雨蒸沙气，高岩返去风。\n骤来应骤解，昨夜月如弓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44550,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其六","author":"袁宏道","text":"山都吟复笑，猩语是耶非。\n易黑江湖面，纯青客旅衣。\n草根鱼子长，沙末燕儿飞。\n家信云梢去，郎归计日归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44551,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其七","author":"袁宏道","text":"云细蒸山出，溪登见底空。\n买盐多妇女，羡水尽儿童。\n江有往来浪，神无南北风。\n暴流皆石齿，得失在头工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44552,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其八","author":"袁宏道","text":"草丰不辨树，山隐却如烟。\n客舫因滩浅，牵夫傍兕眠。\n谁家朝奉去，几得少年还。\n历尽江儿水，嬴来合子钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44553,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其九","author":"袁宏道","text":"浪子由来苦，行人大抵劳。\n山云低压帽，溪雨恶侵袍。\n欲得恣心意，除非伐顶毛。\n将鸥与鹜比，毕竟是谁高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44554,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安江 其十","author":"袁宏道","text":"凉风沁石骨，快雨过山头。\n筏上行沙鼠，云中啸老猴。\n天长鸭绿水，斛许翰青舟。\n万里游垂尽，六休休未休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44555,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠心湛一小师","author":"袁宏道","text":"布衲裁烟雾，蒲团藉草莎。\n雷峰定里火，湖水观中波。\n削发嫌根在，忌言恨舌多。\n少年色力健，魔佛奈他何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44556,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拜长耳和尚肉身","author":"袁宏道","text":"轮相居然足，漆光与鉴新。\n神魂知也未，爪齿幻耶真。\n一个庄严佛，千年骨董人。\n饶他铜与铁，到此亦成尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44557,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"憩法相","author":"袁宏道","text":"峰脚微微仄，篁梢个个清。\n听钟龙忏悔，入室虎经行。\n鞭笋和泥重，头茶带纸轻。\n山僧谈往事，一倍惜尘情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44558,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别黄道元","author":"袁宏道","text":"踪迹频频至，邻僧个个知。\n会多嫌话少，坐久畏驴饥。\n说虎归途快，怀鸳夜梦痴。\n一灯禅榻下，睡著小沙弥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44559,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊戌元日潘景升兄弟偕诸词客邀余及洪子崖知县踏青真州东郊以云霞梅柳句为韵余得度字","author":"袁宏道","text":"一里一停帴，摇摇驻青雾。\n歌长牙扳温，酒响觥筹度。\n雪尽露山身，沙平吞水步。\n涧冷涩春泉，芽香吐枯树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44560,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮安舟中 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"兀兀叹淫滞，西风两日馀。\n近床铺纸叶，研彩类方书。\n触目无非网，登盘只是鱼。\n荒村经水后，十屋九家虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44561,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮安舟中 其四","author":"袁宏道","text":"河堤千里道，柳缕万条肠。\n客是粘愁蒂，禅为治苦方。\n乡思鱼子饭，酒梦蛤蜊汤。\n渐觉读书懒，游蛛网笔床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44562,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿房村","author":"袁宏道","text":"野廓吹加劲，膏微影渐黄。\n残垆煨粪火，败絮拥蒿床。\n站远酸皮骨，沙飞涩胃肠。\n离魂相伴往，合眼见江乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44563,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐州道中","author":"袁宏道","text":"西风吹日夜，千里旱沙黄。\n马急知缰促，人疲觉路长。\n安心犹有法，医懒却无方。\n何不遂长往，淹淹名利场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44564,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"济宁守邀饮南池","author":"袁宏道","text":"踏影入春丛，碑荒榻半空。\n树分菱藻月，滩响鹭鸶风。\n落絮粘行牍，残觥谑小童。\n夜深铃卒语，窗外一枝红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44565,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入燕初遇伯兄述近事","author":"袁宏道","text":"撇却閒嚣冗，残书且自哦。\n官贫人事减，客久面纹多。\n坏壁涂僧豫，高窗见鸟窠。\n词曹虽冷秩，亦复慎风波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44566,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尊经阁偶成","author":"袁宏道","text":"一月户长扃，幽廊雨过腥。\n云生山被酒，客去鸟听经。\n碑古漏痕遍，槐高日影青。\n郑家书带草，随意满斋庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44567,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"学斋留梅子马","author":"袁宏道","text":"踏尽高槐影，青虫落酒巾。\n袖怀三月草，衣浣一年尘。\n梦里听朝事，杯中觅圣人。\n贫厨非大祭，未有肉留宾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44568,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张西麓之任罗平","author":"袁宏道","text":"疋马夜郎西，层山万绿齐。\n空江行罔象，瘦岭出偏蹄。\n番牒多如篆，蛮歌乍似啼。\n僻乡名迹少，慎勿厌标题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44569,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游满井","author":"袁宏道","text":"怪我频来去，无樽亦啸歌。\n店荒酤酒浊，僧近施茶多。\n竹里分黄阙，波间语翠娥。\n溪光最胜处，高柳荫长坡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44570,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘常侍水轩 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"入室翠层层，秋容分外澄。\n花分西内种，树古北朝僧。\n波净寒生簟，峰高夜见灯。\n墨光浓淡里，山水赵吴兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44571,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘常侍水轩 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"随意移床枕，无窗不可眠。\n西山篱落下，流水卷炉边。\n茭叶遮城垒，荻花隐寺田。\n儿童私打网，时有白鱼鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44572,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘常侍水轩 其四","author":"袁宏道","text":"敞屋高临水，卑垣奥作庐。\n山僧能咒树，童子解医鱼。\n剑玦充文具，歌谣集古书。\n之乎亦不识，糟却几盈虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44573,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尊经阁偶题","author":"袁宏道","text":"长戚戚何为，曲肱愧孔尼。\n草髡苗败砌，树老落乾枝。\n飞鸟衔残字，园丁榻旧碑。\n邻斋四五叟，日日染愁髭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44574,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双寺逢本上人","author":"袁宏道","text":"高僧如疼鹤，懒得著袈裟。\n雪案堆庄子，花函藏内家。\n问方医病竹，邮水泛春茶。\n一室沉香气，青烟吐白纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44575,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐小修斋中","author":"袁宏道","text":"寒日篱花少，虚窗五尺馀。\n砚皴呵绣墨，壁老剧垂书。\n定业诗调冶，幽忧酒破除。\n家人攀釜看，绨锦当黄糈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44576,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送白教谕之昌邑","author":"袁宏道","text":"依旧中山氏，长然即墨侯。\n衣宽存礼乐，箧敝裹阳秋。\n渤日流红晕，盐花上黑头。\n到时图海市，东去是登州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44577,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送艾教谕之镇安","author":"袁宏道","text":"一百二秦地，三千五去程。\n山鲜充豆品，野服礼诸生。\n把卷听夷乐，开轩见虎行。\n犹将京国意，一洗近边城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44578,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日杂兴 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"残菊收新药，丹书缀断编。\n砚呵胶婢指，苔老夹冰钱。\n百衲支风惯，空杯见雪颠。\n缄书报知己，霜满蜡花笺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44579,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日杂兴 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"泻纸罗纹滑，飞枰石子寒。\n菊衰愁别蒂，鹤老梦归滩。\n香重红膏泣，粉枯白蠹残。\n寄声询衲病，驰帖报花安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44580,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日杂兴 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"雪炷抽寒焰，辰香扫炙尘。\n谱词分侍女，鬻帖与门人。\n边信封黄鼠，乡心想白鳞。\n卑官与大吏，一种逐蹄轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44581,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日杂兴 其四","author":"袁宏道","text":"残帙随风卷，閒窗尽日哦。\n胆瓶青剥落，梵呗语殽吪。\n寒节逢人少，新诗说酒多。\n小蛮持管笑，呵墨写长蛾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44582,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人临镜 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"一片湖州水，吹光到晓堂。\n暗规时世样，校取浅深妆。\n山髻平分叠，宫眉与斗长。\n常时樈掠罢，背底立何郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44583,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人临镜 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"强起淹馀睡，柔多艳亦多。\n笑时添两靥，恨至叠双蛾。\n印指生寒晕，分钗割水波。\n休将月月比，仙子不如他。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44584,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人临镜 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"野艳云争出，幽閒萼并头。\n分明呈舞态，只是欠歌喉。\n西子不离水，绿珠长在楼。\n娥英若令见，匣取洞庭秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44585,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人临镜 其四","author":"袁宏道","text":"百看百如意，随他作笑颦。\n回钗生溜影，分耀及旁人。\n睡少添自重，思多理注频。\n面光滑似水，脂粉不如尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44586,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送武冈州判张子之任","author":"袁宏道","text":"雉堞倚山乡，青娥立晓堂。\n胥徒勤检点，蛮语细参详。\n湘竹裁荆杖，藤花上牍床。\n荒衢通野落，士女半夷装。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44587,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日","author":"袁宏道","text":"旅况无些子，空扉阅广轮。\n气寒薪少力，客谢几生尘。\n心切投林羽，身悲贷沬鳞。\n滔滔人尽是，未始出非人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44588,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谷日怀潘景升","author":"袁宏道","text":"西湖多少地，客信也难知。\n流落依何氏，巉岏历几支。\n吴娘嗔罄橐，杭粉上愁髭。\n记得拈杯处，题分谷字诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44589,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题龙腾山房","author":"袁宏道","text":"急雨朝翻箔，飞泉夏入庐。\n竹高遗凤子，石长出雷书。\n山鸟衔云语，园丁带翠锄。\n南冈北岭草，枯却几年馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44590,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王氏双节","author":"袁宏道","text":"玉折苦相仍，彤编合并称。\n泪枯双井水，心死万年冰。\n恶粉常芟竹，凄花每避镫。\n霜眉白似缕，阅尽几衰兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44591,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花朝日白苏斋看梅","author":"袁宏道","text":"一倍惜花时，寒香滴酒卮。\n幸依无事客，且喜不蟠枝。\n近枕通幽梦，安禅伴净尼。\n未知白苏老，酬唱几番诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44592,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昌平道中","author":"袁宏道","text":"柳条新婉娈，麦陇渐柔丰。\n闪日云光薄，翻空旆影红。\n马嘶不见鬣，毂响但闻风。\n恰为青山去，青山尘雾中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44593,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢在杭钟樊桐诸凡集郊外","author":"袁宏道","text":"百晤百回新，肝肠绝少尘。\n未言先侧耳，每笑必伤神。\n落翠沾行帢，空罂惑醉人。\n石潭清到底，信手出纤鳞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44594,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李湘洲使浙 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"咫尺山东道，千艘与万舻。\n邮栖常下鹤，驿饭一炊菰。\n闭口听朝事，降心祖佛徒。\n不言知向越，面上有西湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44595,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李湘洲使浙 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"别路红桥上，无情亦有歌。\n青山遮道石，流水拍云波。\n北阙新知少，西湖熟梦多。\n向来题字处，墨沈遍嵯峨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44596,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日集江进之王以明方子公王章甫小修饮崇国寺","author":"袁宏道","text":"露叶滴秋窗，竹香入酒缸。\n娇青槐子破，浅嫩菊丫双。\n石火增茶韵，松音出梵腔。\n冥心真契理，瓮里有莲邦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44597,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日天慧寺登高迟家伯修黄平倩不至","author":"袁宏道","text":"苍色满诸峦，如何独自看。\n閒僧四五众，丈石两三盘。\n白额题高冢，红衫度远栏。\n北风浸骨冷，端不似秋残。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44598,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过通州","author":"袁宏道","text":"白舫绿油扉，多时梦亦稀。\n浪中丹雉见，郭里水禽飞。\n古寺荒何代，空杨瘦十围。\n四年一带水，三度断肠归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44599,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒溪道中","author":"袁宏道","text":"空岩著古花，石路水纹斜。\n瘦野多耘枣，桑门屡饷茶。\n逢人皆说旱，上马但愁砂。\n匣地诛求尽，孤云也失家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44600,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丛台","author":"袁宏道","text":"梦绕陌花薰，残宫没野耘。\n秋空吪凤泪，阴谷女龙云。\n古水空沉照，飞蛾每化裙。\n苔封埋半碣，斑剥有遗文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44601,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中过王官谷香光林 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"脱屐入春丛，拾芳携翠笼。\n一番洗竹雨，几阵报花风。\n薪老知茶忌，须长论药功。\n疏黄秾碧里，一树石楠红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44602,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中过王官谷香光林 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"为药常烧竹，贪僧每贮粮。\n观心三点字，叠膝一绳床。\n谱石增新样，和香觅旧方。\n黄柑栽未几，已得五拳长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":44603,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]